
---

## ⚙️ **.gitignore**
```gitignore
# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Flask instance folder
instance/

# Virtual environment
venv/
env/
.venv/
.env/

# Model and data cache
*.pkl
*.joblib

# Logs
*.log

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/

# Jupyter checkpoints (if used)
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Node modules (if any JS package added)
node_modules/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.bak
